  unitName: Turbo Netherhound
  unitId: 860125
  unitNumber: 8073
  description: Netherhounds were created by Gazia, a demi-god fallen into his abyss
    of power and stature during the days of the augmentation wars in Athensphere.
    They were first used to guard places of importance until the war broke out. It
    was said that using forbidden technology, Gazia infused the soul of living captured
    conciousness of wolves into its mechanical processes. The heightened conciousness
    of netherhounds enable them to move and hunt enemies undetected, swiftly and
    deadly.
